# Apify API token — enables live LinkedIn scraping in /api/evaluate.
# Without it, /in/aranyabandhu/ falls back to a bundled sample scrape and other
# profiles return an "add a token" note (the card still builds from X + demo).
#
# Get one: https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
# Local:   copy this file to .env  (or export APIFY_TOKEN=...) before `npm run dev`
# Vercel:  Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add APIFY_TOKEN
APIFY_TOKEN=
